{"title":"Frostfang","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 66 Frost Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frostfang\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frostfang?lv=66\">Lv 66</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frostfang?lv=69\">Lv 69 <span>14</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frostfang?lv=66\" title=\"Pick level 66\"><td><b>66</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>497</td><td>40.8</td><td>3,300</td><td class=\"muted\">1,491 · 57.1 · 9,900</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frostfang?lv=69\" title=\"Pick level 69\"><td><b>69</b></td><td>518</td><td>42.5</td><td>3,450</td><td class=\"muted\">1,554 · 59.5 · 10,350</td><td>14</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/93d0a58e5998e4981375.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/broken-fang-battlespear\"><b>The Broken Fang</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Titanium Battlespear, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+25% damage against a target below 30% hitpoints.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9fa142035756a98cfeba.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/skyfall-longbow\"><b>Skyfall</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+30% damage against a target fighting someone else.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f86582b265b7547b36c9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/whiteout-staff\"><b>Whiteout</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Your spell effects last longer. Burns tick 1 more times, chills last 2 seconds longer, stuns 0.5 seconds longer and Corroded 1 second longer. Against players only burns and Corroded last longer.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 239 total, 239 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×239</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-feet\" title=\"Glimmerfox Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/6e15349c74d396797513.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-arms\" title=\"Thorn Arms - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e0c6f0d49af674afeae9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Frostfang&#39;s Eyrie</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 14</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6505\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Frost Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/frost-drake\">Frost Drake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon\">Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skarnwing\">Skarnwing</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-frost-dragon\">Elder Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mother-hvit\">Mother Hvit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ysgar\">Ysgar the Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/700f9e5ba31e0809b9c3.svg\" alt=\"Frostfang\"></div><h3>Frostfang</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>66 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 69–69)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Frost Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>497</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>40.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.9</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (10 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}